phi-adapter-matter (0.0.1+chip1.5.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: connectedhomeip fetched at v1.5.1.0 and chip-tool built
    from it for this architecture. No adapter code yet - the build is the
    milestone, because a stack that cannot be packaged is not a stack.
  * The CHIP tag is part of the package version, so what was built is visible
    in apt and not only in a file inside the package.
  * Build time and binary size are recorded into the package under
    /usr/share/doc, because those two numbers decide whether the sbuild host
    and a Pi-class machine can carry this.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Sat, 05 Sep 2026 10:00:00 +0200
